      "writtenOn": "2023-09-08T15:59:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Gotcha. Yeah, that makes sense. I see we have a TODO in RenderPassDesc to determine and store render pass bounds, exact and/or granular, which will presumably be calculated from considering the bounds of all the draw commands contained within it. https://skia.googlesource.com/skia.git/+/refs/heads/main/src/gpu/graphite/AttachmentTypes.h#78\n\nFor now, I added a granularity attribute to VulkanRenderPass so it\u0027s accessible later on, used the frame buffer bounds, and added an appropriate TODO.",
